      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 25.38,
      "end": 29.64,
      "text": "Before the lawn, before the traffic, before you understand.",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 30.74,
      "end": 35.32,
      "text": "There is a river under your reds, older than every rule",
      "uncertain": false
    },
    {
      "start": 35.32,
      "end": 40.6,
      "text": "The question is not whether it runs, it is whether you close the loop",
      "uncertain": true
    },
    {
